              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Common Mistakes",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`AdministratorAccess` or `*` on `*` to fix AccessDenied",
                "Policies on users, not groups",
                "Keys committed to git",
                "Role needs a ==trust policy== and a permissions policy"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "ink": "red"
